# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets policy (Option B — confirmed by founder, 2026-02-09):
# All production secrets live in the EMERGENT DEPLOYMENT DASHBOARD,
# NOT in committed .env files. So .env MUST stay ignored — this
# prevents accidental `git add .` from leaking Stripe / Mongo /
# JWT_SECRET / etc. to the GitHub repo.
#
# DO NOT remove these lines. The platform auto-re-adds them anyway
# because they are correct. The previous "iter 108 deploy failure"
# was caused by MISSING dashboard env vars, NOT by a committed
# .env file.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
credentials.json
*.key
.credentials
.env
.env.*
*.env
